      <activity id="72b5ceb4-76b0-582d-9811-528d73eaff4f" activityNameId="0f806980-500b-5ed1-92a9-c28ab2d33977" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, tram</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, tram
Average data for the operation of Swiss trams. The data has been determined top down, by combining the total yearly energy consumption and the yearly vkm-performance. Particulate emissions due to abrasion of rail tracks, wheels, brakes and overhead contact line is included. For a first estimate of European trams, the user may change the electricity mix.;
UUID: ad25793a-52eb-34d6-bb30-b350d18de185
The inventory includes the actual energy consumption due to traction. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: all technologies included
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 369 Mio pkm in 2000  in Switzerland
Sampling: national statistics and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ad25793a-52eb-34d6-bb30-b350d18de185.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
